From: XOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] gzguts.h: include errno declarations on XOS

The XOS SDK's unistd.h does not transitively include errno.h. zlib's gzip
reader uses errno and EAGAIN/EWOULDBLOCK, so include the standard header
explicitly for this target.

--- a/gzguts.h
+++ b/gzguts.h
@@ -32,4 +32,5 @@
 #include <stdio.h>
+#include <errno.h>
 #include "zlib.h"
 #ifdef STDC
 #  include <string.h>
